00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:24.720
<i>In their search for capable males-</i>

00:01:24.770 --> 00:01:29.970
<i>- Silver meets the wild
dogs "the brothers from Kai".</i>

00:01:30.190 --> 00:01:33.990
<i>Akatora, Chutora and Kurotora.</i>

00:01:34.150 --> 00:01:39.650
<i>To get these powerful trio
in Ben's platoon, was not easy.</i>

00:01:40.170 --> 00:01:45.890
<i>But in the heat of battle,
Akatora recognized Ben.</i>

00:01:46.720 --> 00:01:52.780
<i>Ben was the dog who saved their
lives when they were puppies.</i>

00:01:54.110 --> 00:01:59.250
<i>With brothers from Kai in the pack, they
continued the pursuit of capable males.</i>

00:01:59.750 --> 00:02:04.640
<i>But no one knew that among
them was a traitor-</i>

00:02:04.760 --> 00:02:09.150
<i>only obeyed the orders of the Sniper.</i>

00:02:13.270 --> 00:02:20.990
MONSTER!
MOSS' ARMY IN THE MISTY MOUNTAINS

00:02:22.170 --> 00:02:25.020
Ben, there's the Misty mountain.

00:02:25.470 --> 00:02:27.030
This is where the Pig lives.

00:02:27.720 --> 00:02:31.030
He has surely has become even
bigger than last time.

00:02:31.120 --> 00:02:36.030
And that's why he is called the pig? I see.
He don't seem to be so pleasant.

00:02:37.540 --> 00:02:38.790
The reason is...

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:41.040
That he has a huge pack.

00:02:41.040 --> 00:02:44.060
He has sought to enlist us
several times!

00:02:44.110 --> 00:02:46.220
Only to widen his territory!

00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:49.060
He just thinks he matters!

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:50.300
You think so?

00:02:51.570 --> 00:02:53.310
It doesn't sound like that.

00:02:54.030 --> 00:02:55.310
What do you mean, Ben?

00:02:56.240 --> 00:03:02.340
That his pack is big, just
means that he has charisma.

00:03:02.420 --> 00:03:03.500
But Ben...

00:03:03.720 --> 00:03:09.030
He has tried to get the brothers Kai
despite the fact that they hate him.

00:03:09.560 --> 00:03:12.030
He knows what he's doing.

00:03:12.190 --> 00:03:13.330
Am I wrong?

00:03:16.530 --> 00:03:18.630
One point to Ben, Akatora.

00:03:19.210 --> 00:03:22.130
He has known you
since you were young.

00:03:22.210 --> 00:03:26.380
You should probably give Ben
right here.

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:29.140
Hey!

00:03:35.570 --> 00:03:40.190
<i>I want to meet you now, Moss!</i>

00:03:42.300 --> 00:03:43.390
Stop there!

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:45.650
Where are you, Hyena?

00:03:46.130 --> 00:03:48.400
We may as well rest while it's raining?

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:51.650
Nature is calling.
Do I need permission for it?

00:03:52.190 --> 00:03:54.790
Don't go too far.

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:57.540
I'm no child, as some others are!

00:03:58.210 --> 00:03:59.290
What did you say?!

00:03:59.420 --> 00:04:04.790
Don't bother, Silver.
He can't do anything without Sniper.

00:04:04.890 --> 00:04:07.940
He is just in bad mood that he
ended up in our group.

00:04:09.100 --> 00:04:13.430
We are friends with the same goal here.
No prejudices here!

00:04:20.250 --> 00:04:21.770
Stop!

00:04:24.300 --> 00:04:26.020
W-w-where?

00:04:26.020 --> 00:04:28.520
Was it you that shouted after me?

00:04:28.890 --> 00:04:30.030
Who are you?

00:04:33.900 --> 00:04:35.660
W-w-wait!

00:04:36.610 --> 00:04:40.160
I don't want to fight against
the Moss from the Misty mountain!

00:04:40.320 --> 00:04:42.410
I have the information!

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:44.660
Information, you say?

00:04:55.580 --> 00:04:59.390
Moss from Misty mountain!
Twice as big as Ben!

00:05:02.010 --> 00:05:03.770
It finally stopped.

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:05.770
Time to go?

00:05:06.080 --> 00:05:13.030
Ben! If Moss doesn't listen,
we want payback for everything he has done!

00:05:13.780 --> 00:05:15.530
You're really nagging!

00:05:16.030 --> 00:05:21.540
Then I will also fight.
If he really is a capable male.

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:23.290
Let's go!

00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:24.470
Wait, Ben!

00:05:25.850 --> 00:05:28.710
Hyena, then?
He hasn't returned yet.

00:05:29.520 --> 00:05:30.870
Oh right.

00:05:30.920 --> 00:05:34.970
That numbskull! Typical!
I'll go and look for him.

00:05:35.370 --> 00:05:36.970
Ben, me too?

00:05:37.150 --> 00:05:38.170
Okay.

00:05:39.580 --> 00:05:41.230
Smith! I'm coming too!

00:05:43.220 --> 00:05:46.650
For young ones like him, it's
painful to rest.

00:05:46.910 --> 00:05:51.400
The best for Silver, is to let him
explore the world a little.

00:05:54.030 --> 00:05:57.820
I see, then think that I understand.

00:05:58.330 --> 00:06:04.910
If the my leader hadn't been fooled by the
Kai-brothers, I wouldn't have to run away.

00:06:05.850 --> 00:06:08.170
Then, I'll be on my way...

00:06:09.040 --> 00:06:10.170
Take care!

00:06:12.820 --> 00:06:16.430
I don't trust that guys eyes.

00:06:16.790 --> 00:06:20.430
Jaguar! What do you think?

00:06:20.840 --> 00:06:27.990
Father, I can't believe he would trick
that Ben to fight us.

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:30.180
You are right.

00:06:30.860 --> 00:06:37.360
We have been fighting for the turf a long
time, but they would never ask for help.

00:06:37.660 --> 00:06:43.610
Anyway, Moss. It seems
that they are in ambush.

00:06:44.220 --> 00:06:49.710
The triplets may have changed
their mind after meeting Ben.

00:06:51.030 --> 00:06:56.710
If they intend to show their fangs
to me, they're gonna be crushed!

00:06:57.160 --> 00:07:00.470
You two go spy on them!

00:07:01.300 --> 00:07:02.320
Jaguar!

00:07:03.980 --> 00:07:11.680
It is enough to find out their number.
Do not attack on your own!

00:07:11.740 --> 00:07:13.240
Yes, father.

00:07:13.470 --> 00:07:17.990
Don't worry!
Junior's a good soldier. See you!

00:07:19.420 --> 00:07:21.590
Soldier huh?

00:07:22.460 --> 00:07:25.950
Where the hell did that Hyena go?

00:07:26.330 --> 00:07:29.200
We are already inside the Moss' territory!

00:07:30.570 --> 00:07:31.710
Smith, somebody is coming!

00:07:31.770 --> 00:07:32.370
Hyena?

00:07:32.430 --> 00:07:36.210
No, one... no, two!
Let's hide !

00:07:40.710 --> 00:07:41.970
It's Moss' males.

00:07:43.640 --> 00:07:44.720
Where are they going?

00:07:45.430 --> 00:07:46.440
There!

00:07:47.270 --> 00:07:48.990
You!

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:50.440
Hyena!

00:07:50.650 --> 00:07:53.690
What do you want? Are you still here?

00:07:54.620 --> 00:07:57.190
I'm not finished here yet.

00:07:57.240 --> 00:07:58.320
What?

00:08:02.380 --> 00:08:05.020
That stupid! Is he out of his mind?

00:08:05.490 --> 00:08:08.210
Ben's not going to be
able to negotiate any more!

00:08:08.310 --> 00:08:09.750
What the hell are you doing?

00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:11.000
We must stop them!

00:08:11.900 --> 00:08:13.170
Mr. Sniper!

00:08:14.810 --> 00:08:15.910
That's?

00:08:39.210 --> 00:08:40.310
<i>Sniper!</i>

00:08:45.310 --> 00:08:47.410
<i>The officer Sniper!!</i>

00:08:47.520 --> 00:08:49.160
<i>What is he doing here?</i>

00:08:49.570 --> 00:08:51.920
Damn! Who are you?

00:08:53.280 --> 00:08:56.750
Do you want to know that,
Jaguar, Moss son?

00:08:58.960 --> 00:09:00.820
He is Moss' son?

00:09:01.550 --> 00:09:03.850
You will know before you die!

00:09:05.100 --> 00:09:09.850
I'm the one who wants to start a fight
between Ben and Moss!

00:09:15.300 --> 00:09:16.450
Die!

00:09:25.800 --> 00:09:27.540
The final blow!

00:09:36.210 --> 00:09:38.000
You bastard! Silver!

00:09:38.670 --> 00:09:41.340
Now Silver has messed up things!

00:09:41.550 --> 00:09:45.840
What are you doing, officer?
Why Are you ruining for Ben?

00:09:46.560 --> 00:09:51.290
You're young, Silver. A kid like you
may not understand-

00:09:51.450 --> 00:09:56.100
- but Ben is "in the way" for the officer.
Am I right?

00:09:56.290 --> 00:09:58.100
How dare you speak...

00:09:58.150 --> 00:10:00.350
Shut up! You traitor!

00:10:01.680 --> 00:10:04.240
They fooled father...

00:10:05.810 --> 00:10:07.740
Silver! Die!

00:10:12.110 --> 00:10:13.290
<i>What?</i>

00:10:17.540 --> 00:10:21.090
<i>As fast as the leader.
He really is his son.</i>

00:10:21.720 --> 00:10:24.720
<i>Even more reason to kill him.</i>

00:10:24.870 --> 00:10:25.900
<i>He attacks!</i>

00:10:27.650 --> 00:10:30.930
No! You have no chance against him!

00:10:32.990 --> 00:10:36.060
<i>Do you know why I'm called Sniper?</i>

00:10:36.080 --> 00:10:40.900
<i>Sniper means "sniper".
They never miss.</i>

00:10:45.280 --> 00:10:46.110
Silver!

00:10:57.170 --> 00:11:00.500
<i>Unbelievable!
He escaped and survived.</i>

00:11:02.370 --> 00:11:04.760
What do you think of a Doberman's teeth?

00:11:08.150 --> 00:11:11.260
Time to go to hell.

00:11:13.920 --> 00:11:15.020
Good!

00:11:17.710 --> 00:11:20.270
Now it's over, kid!

00:11:25.610 --> 00:11:28.450
Damn you! You bastard!

00:11:28.950 --> 00:11:30.700
Stop there! Stay!

00:11:31.680 --> 00:11:33.200
After them! Hunt!

00:11:33.740 --> 00:11:38.200
<i>Silver, you idiot! Courage is
not enough.</i>

00:12:07.310 --> 00:12:10.820
Stupid idiots. To come here and disturb.

00:12:11.200 --> 00:12:15.620
Mr. Sniper, it's not far off until
you become the leader.

00:12:37.340 --> 00:12:38.680
Smith!

00:12:38.840 --> 00:12:40.640
Smith!

00:12:43.770 --> 00:12:44.820
Smith!

00:12:45.690 --> 00:12:46.820
Smith!

00:12:57.670 --> 00:12:59.890
Smith! Hold on!

00:13:01.390 --> 00:13:07.120
Silver... it's over.
I think my leg is broken. Let me go!

00:13:07.360 --> 00:13:12.380
What are you saying?
You saved me from Sniper!

00:13:12.620 --> 00:13:17.630
Stupid kid! Anyone in the pack
would've done that.

00:13:17.790 --> 00:13:19.640
Hurry up! Let go of me!

00:13:28.730 --> 00:13:33.280
Silver! Let go of me!
You're not dying here! Drop!

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:38.370
Anyone in the pack would've
done this.

00:13:53.290 --> 00:13:57.130
They're late. Neither Smith
nor Silver have come back.

00:13:58.710 --> 00:13:59.640
What if...

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:02.890
Akatora! You're gonna howl nonsense, huh?

00:14:03.720 --> 00:14:04.900
But...

00:14:07.110 --> 00:14:08.900
It smells like blood...

00:14:18.460 --> 00:14:21.660
<i>Jaguar, badly wounded,
had gone to Ben-</i>

00:14:21.760 --> 00:14:25.410
<i>- to stop the battle that Sniper
tried to start.</i>

00:14:25.560 --> 00:14:29.250
<i>And to tell that Silver and
Smith is in danger.</i>

00:14:29.460 --> 00:14:32.300
<i>But it was all he
could come up with.</i>

00:14:34.710 --> 00:14:36.800
What has happened? Who are you?

00:14:36.850 --> 00:14:39.050
Are you... Ben?

00:14:40.890 --> 00:14:42.060
Hey!

00:14:43.600 --> 00:14:44.900
He is...!

00:14:45.980 --> 00:14:48.110
Do you know who this is, Akatora?

00:14:48.780 --> 00:14:51.610
Yes! It is Moss's son, Jaguar!

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:53.740
What? He is?

00:14:54.460 --> 00:14:55.280
Ben!

00:14:57.280 --> 00:15:00.480
I can't believe Silver and
Smith would attack.

00:15:00.510 --> 00:15:04.950
Don't be sure of that! If the opponent
shows his fangs, he will attack!

00:15:05.020 --> 00:15:07.200
It is so bear hounds fight!

00:15:08.740 --> 00:15:11.380
Have Silver been... killed by Moss?

00:15:11.620 --> 00:15:14.710
Kurotora! No way...

00:15:24.560 --> 00:15:26.310
Okay! Let's go!

00:15:30.450 --> 00:15:32.190
Stay in line!

00:15:47.110 --> 00:15:49.880
Smith... Smith...!

00:15:51.780 --> 00:15:53.670
Can you hear me, Smith?

00:15:56.210 --> 00:15:58.670
You have been and...

00:15:59.420 --> 00:16:00.470
Thank god!!!

00:16:00.860 --> 00:16:03.470
Your little...!
Thinking that you're something...!

00:16:05.830 --> 00:16:10.230
You seem fine.
I thought you died.

00:16:11.660 --> 00:16:19.660
<i>Silver... thanks! I'll save my
pitiful life for your sake!</i>

00:16:20.230 --> 00:16:22.740
Let's hurry to Ben!

00:16:23.100 --> 00:16:26.240
Don't slow down just
because you saved my life.

00:16:26.430 --> 00:16:28.240
Speak for yourself!

00:16:29.070 --> 00:16:33.240
<i>That's right. If Ben falls into
Sniper's trap, it's over!</i>

00:16:41.510 --> 00:16:43.510
How dare they...?!

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:46.120
Incredible! Dead with one blow!

00:16:46.520 --> 00:16:47.270
Stone-dead!

00:16:47.810 --> 00:16:51.770
So my son Jaguar wasn't here?

00:16:53.660 --> 00:16:58.020
We were searching, after
we found Lloyd dead.

00:16:59.220 --> 00:17:02.030
But we fear that even Junior...

00:17:05.940 --> 00:17:11.000
Those sneaky bastards!
They'll all regret this!

00:17:11.020 --> 00:17:12.830
Come on, males!

00:17:13.290 --> 00:17:20.080
The triplets Kai is going to die! Ben is
going to die! They'll die, all of them!

00:17:31.330 --> 00:17:32.370
Wait, Ben!

00:17:33.830 --> 00:17:34.900
What is it, Akatora?

00:17:35.210 --> 00:17:36.300
It smells like.

00:17:37.710 --> 00:17:41.900
It smells like... The pig is here!

00:17:42.680 --> 00:17:43.910
Huh?

00:17:44.060 --> 00:17:45.110
In the vicinity!

00:17:45.700 --> 00:17:51.950
Kai dogs! You have good muzzles!
Too bad for such good males!

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:57.200
If you hadn't done this,
I would have let you lived.

00:18:12.120 --> 00:18:13.600
Moss...

00:18:15.700 --> 00:18:19.860
Are you Ben?
Where is my son?

00:18:25.020 --> 00:18:27.370
Where is the Silver?

00:18:31.460 --> 00:18:33.000
Eat this!

00:18:40.080 --> 00:18:41.790
Watch out! Step aside!

00:18:54.040 --> 00:18:55.480
Cross!

00:19:21.420 --> 00:19:22.490
<i>Ben!</i>

00:19:30.580 --> 00:19:31.810
Ben!

00:19:32.550 --> 00:19:33.580
Wait, Cross!

00:19:34.480 --> 00:19:36.680
Drop, drop, Akatora!

00:19:41.560 --> 00:19:42.610
Ben!

00:19:44.410 --> 00:19:47.110
Give up, Cross. It is too late.

00:19:47.970 --> 00:19:50.410
Ben... My fault!

00:19:55.090 --> 00:19:58.160
What?! Is that true, Jaguar?!

00:19:59.640 --> 00:20:03.460
Yes, I wanted to... tell you...

00:20:04.190 --> 00:20:07.460
Impossible! Would officer Sniper...

00:20:11.700 --> 00:20:13.970
How is it? Can you stand?

00:20:14.130 --> 00:20:18.470
It's okay. Just a little rest.
We have to hurry...

00:20:19.520 --> 00:20:22.980
For the little one who rescued me.

00:20:28.110 --> 00:20:31.910
We have to tell father, or
Ben's gonna get hurt!

00:20:45.510 --> 00:20:49.170
Crap also!
Ben!

00:20:53.150 --> 00:20:58.930
Males! Don't let a single one
leave Misty mountain alive!

00:21:02.890 --> 00:21:07.210
Ben's killer! You're gonna die!
Everyone, attack!

00:21:12.020 --> 00:21:13.700
<i>Many against few...</i>

00:21:14.270 --> 00:21:16.700
<i>Ben's platoon was in great disadvantage.</i>

00:21:17.760 --> 00:21:22.950
<i>But with Ben gone it was not the time
to think about things like that.</i>

00:21:23.370 --> 00:21:27.450
You bastards! Now you've pissed us off.
Get ready to die?!

00:21:43.270 --> 00:21:47.110
What's taking you so long, slowpokes?

00:21:51.460 --> 00:21:53.110
Good! Way to go, big brother!

00:21:57.170 --> 00:21:58.200
Akatora!

00:22:01.640 --> 00:22:02.960
Big brother!

00:22:05.860 --> 00:22:06.920
Akatora!

00:22:11.780 --> 00:22:14.430
It went well, Mr. Sniper.

00:22:16.360 --> 00:22:19.680
<i>Silver and Smith rushed forward!</i>

00:22:22.230 --> 00:22:26.190
<i>"We need to tell you about the
Sniper's plan for Ben and Moss!"</i>

00:22:28.690 --> 00:22:32.690
<i>Silver ignored the pain and
ran as fast as he could.</i>

00:22:34.540 --> 00:22:40.950
<i>How could they know that Ben
had already been buried by Moss?</i>
